Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 15:49:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/12] feat: normalize DeepSeek DSML tool calls

Parse DeepSeek DSML text tool calls into native tool_calls so the tool loop executes them, and force a tool-free final answer when the tool-call iteration limit is reached.
